@startuml
start
- Open "Users" panel
- Select "Manage Access"
- Select a user
switch(Choose object type)
case(compute group)
  :Show compute groups;
case(container)
  :Show containers;
case(storage group)
  :Show storage groups;
endswitch
switch(Is an object instance selected?)
case(yes)
fork
  :Change
object visibility;
fork again
  :Change permission
to use object;
fork again
  :Change permission
to modify object;
fork again
  :Change permission
to delete object;
end fork
case(no)
:Change object creation permissions;
endswitch
- Commit changes
stop
@enduml